block_has.container.settings.time_for_hunter_to_wait.tooltip=After the box hide and seek game begins, the hiding person takes the lead in entering the map and begins to hide. After waiting in the waiting hall for a period of time, the hunter begins to find the hidden box. [Unit: Second] (machine translation)
